WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:07.528
Snow White ran deep into the forest.

2
00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:12.746
Branches pulled her hair.

3
00:00:12.747 --> 00:00:17.888
Thorns scratched her arms and hands.

4
00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:25.375
Snow White climbed over rocks and tree roots.

5
00:00:25.376 --> 00:00:30.085
At last she stopped to rest.

6
00:00:30.086 --> 00:00:33.961
"How big is this forest?" Snow White said.

7
00:00:33.962 --> 00:00:36.759
"I've walked for hours.

8
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.240
Now I'm lost, and it's getting late."

9
00:00:40.241 --> 00:00:44.543
Dark shadows stretched across the forest floor.

10
00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.965
A chilly wind shook tree branches.

11
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:54.097
Dead leaves blew through the air.

12
00:00:54.098 --> 00:00:57.467
"I must find shelter," Snow White said.

13
00:00:57.468 --> 00:00:59.543
She looked around.

14
00:00:59.544 --> 00:01:01.509
"But where?"

15
00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.330
Snap!

16
00:01:03.331 --> 00:01:05.508
Snow White held her breath.

17
00:01:05.509 --> 00:01:07.765
She stared into the darkness.

18
00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:11.613
Was the hunter coming back for her?

19
00:01:11.614 --> 00:01:18.900
Snow White ran.

20
00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:21.798
Branches hit her face.

21
00:01:21.799 --> 00:01:24.733
Her foot caught a tree root.

22
00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:30.697
Snow White tumbled down a hill.

23
00:01:30.698 --> 00:01:34.402
When she sat up, she saw a pair of eyes.

24
00:01:34.403 --> 00:01:36.738
"A wolf!" she thought.

25
00:01:36.739 --> 00:01:42.133
Growling, the wolf stepped closer.

26
00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:49.039
The wolf looked deep into Snow White's eyes.

27
00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.026
Suddenly the wolf's face changed.

28
00:01:52.027 --> 00:01:56.026
The wolf wagged its tail and then ran off.

29
00:01:56.027 --> 00:02:00.141
"That was strange," Snow White thought.

30
00:02:00.142 --> 00:02:05.463
As Snow White stood up, she saw something.

31
00:02:05.464 --> 00:02:09.328
A faint light twinkled through the trees.

32
00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:15.948
Snow White gasped.

33
00:02:15.949 --> 00:02:20.276
"I see a house!"

